config BR2_PACKAGE_GAUGE
	bool "gauge"
	help
	  Shows the battery on the four lights on the side: a bar filling
	  while charging, a red flash when the battery is low, and the level
	  when asked (SIGUSR1). ZyperOS sends it more on the FIFO /run/gauge:
	  the volume or brightness while it changes, a climb when files or
	  covers finish, a sparkle for an achievement; and from usbdrive or
	  ZyperOS, a wave while files move to or from the card. ZyperOS's
	  MENU > Side Lights picks which parts show
	  (words in .userdata/pixel2/side-lights on the card, read again on
	  SIGHUP). Started by init, with respawn.
